    registry number as listed on that public record (bare fact, not the
    proprietary CAS arrangement).
  LICENCE of this staged record: identity facts are public domain.
  PROPERTY VALUES: NONE copied from any compilation.  The proposed joback
    groups below feed Choupo's OWN estimator (bin/estimate acetonitrile) — that is the
    legal route to Tc/Pc/omega/Antoine/Cp/dHf as Choupo's open work.
